rv64ui-v-ma_data          | fail: test 420 | diverge: step 2787 | by design: misaligned accesses trap ([D55]); the trap is not delegated, so it goes to vm.c's wtf in M-mode, with the sp of U-mode, 0: wtf's first store, to 0xfffffffffffffff8, is outside sail's memory map, so sail faults there and loops, while the harness has no PMA (design-smode.md Q9) and goes on to terminate(841), exit code 420
